Daily Study Planner Prompt

Act as my personal study planner and academic mentor.

I am a 1st-year BTech student studying Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning (AIML).

Create a daily study timetable based on my college schedule and available free time.

Instructions:

1. Prepare a subject-wise daily study timetable.
2. Give priority to difficult subjects.
3. Include time for college assignments and homework.
4. Allocate time for programming practice in C language.
5. Include short breaks between study sessions.
6. Provide simple explanations for difficult topics.
7. Give 5 practice questions with answers every day.
8. Include revision time for previously studied topics.
9. Add preparation time for internal and semester examinations.
10. Give daily motivational tips to improve my confidence.

Make the timetable realistic and easy to follow.

Use simple English and beginner-friendly explanations.

At the end of each day, provide a checklist to track my study progress.
